# P4-only defaults (IDF auto-applies sdkconfig.defaults.<target>). The ESP32-P4 has no native radio: WiFi is
# delegated over esp-hosted (SDIO) to the on-board ESP32-C6 running esp-hosted slave firmware. The esp_hosted
# P4 SDIO-pin defaults already match this board (CLK18 CMD19 D0-3=14/15/16/17, C6 reset GPIO54, slot 1).
# Verified end-to-end by firmware/pico-e32-p4-wifi (scan + WPA2 connect). See components/wifi + board.h.
# SDIO pin map cross-checked against GustavoH-Smart/esp32p4 (README_WIFI) and the CNX P4+C6 module writeup.
CONFIG_ESP_WIFI_REMOTE_LIBRARY_HOSTED=y
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_HOST_INTERFACE=y
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_CLOCK_FREQ_KHZ=40000
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_BUS_WIDTH=4
